      "prompt": "不做数值计算，判断下列反应中哪些在温度升高时会使反应的自由能变减小，即变得不那么正或更负。并加以解释。<br>（a）${\\text{N}}_{2}(g)+{\\text{3H}}_{2}(g)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;{\\text{2NH}}_{3}(g)$<br>（b）$\\text{HCl}(g)+{\\text{NH}}_{3}(g)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;{\\text{NH}}_{4}\\text{Cl}(s)$<br>（c）${({\\text{NH}}_{4})}_{2}{\\text{Cr}}_{2}{\\text{O}}_{7}(s)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;{\\text{Cr}}_{2}{\\text{O}}_{3}(s)+{\\text{4H}}_{2}\\text{O}(g)+{\\text{N}}_{2}(g)$<br>（d）$\\text{2Fe}(s)+{\\text{3O}}_{2}(g)\\;\\longrightarrow \\;{\\text{Fe}}_{2}{\\text{O}}_{3}(s)$",
